essional is an American emo/alternative act whose 2002 live album MTV Unplugged 2.0 went platinum and charted #111 on Billboard 200, and they released radio singles in 2006 such as “Rooftops and Invitations” and “Don’t Wait”. Provide citations.\n\nWe need to cite each fact: Escanaba formation: sentence 0 of Escanaba Firing Line. Live at Belmont: sentence 0 and 1 of Live at the Belmont. Live at Short's: sentence 0 and 1 of Live at Short's 2005. Dashboard MTV Unplugged: sentence 0,1,5 maybe. Singles: \"Rooftops and Invitations\" release: sentence 2 of that. \"Don't Wait\" release: sentence 3 of that.\n\nWe need to list citations as list of pairs. Provide each pair.\n\nMake answer concise but include comparison. Provide JSON with answer and citations.\n\nLet's craft answer: \"Escanaba Firing Line is a Michigan rock band formed in 2002 that issues limited‑edition live albums such as Live at the Belmont (2010) and Live at Short’s (2006) which were offered as free downloads, while Dashboard Confessional is an American emo/alternative act whose 2002 live album MTV Unplugged 2.0 earned platinum certification and reached #111 on the Billboard 200, and who released radio singles in 2006 like “Rooftops and Invitations” and “Don’t Wait”.\" Provide citations.\n\nCitations list: \n[\"Escanaba Firing Line\",0],\n[\"Live at the Belmont\",0],\n[\"Live at the Belmont\",1],\n[\"Live at Short's 2005\",0],\n[\"Live at Short's 2005\",1],\n[\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",0],\n[\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",1],\n[\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",5],\n[\"Rooftops and Invitations\",2],\n[\"Don't Wait (Dashboard Confessional song)\",3]\n\nMake sure titles match exactly as given. Titles: \"Escanaba Firing Line\", \"Live at the Belmont\", \"Live at Short's 2005\", \"MTV Unplugged 2.0\", \"Rooftops and Invitations\", \"Don't Wait (Dashboard Confessional song)\". Provide.\n\nReturn JSON."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1232,"completion_tokens":985,"total_tokens":2217,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":17